(4729115, 682963, 28742, '<td valign="top">The expression pretty much kills most of the positives about this as a portrait. That is one of the grumpiest, meanest looks I''ve ever seen. I guess if you titled it "Disgruntled Cowboy" it might work better as maybe a photojournalistic portrait. The technicals are all excellent - lighting, focus, comp. But the expression just sets the tone for the overall portrait.</td>', 'The expression pretty much kills most of the positives about this as a portrait. That is one of the grumpiest, meanest looks I''ve ever seen. I guess if you titled it "Disgruntled Cowboy" it might work better as maybe a photojournalistic portrait. The technicals are all excellent - lighting, focus, comp. But the expression just sets the tone for the overall portrait.', '2008-05-28 04:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
