(4730017, 682390, 68546, '<td valign="top">very red, and lots of noise in the colour on the arm, I guess this is some form of HDR or Shadow/highlights boosting up midtone brightness. Pose, lighting, viewpoint are all fine and this would have been a lot better with exposure compensation to get the lighter midtones rather then processing IMO</td>', 'very red, and lots of noise in the colour on the arm, I guess this is some form of HDR or Shadow/highlights boosting up midtone brightness. Pose, lighting, viewpoint are all fine and this would have been a lot better with exposure compensation to get the lighter midtones rather then processing IMO', '2008-05-28 12:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
