(4730508, 681139, 88590, '<td valign="top">Very nice - I like that''s it''s a striking composition.  It just feels a little too ''soft'' - maybe a bit oof?  Still, though, an excellent idea!</td>', 'Very nice - I like that''s it''s a striking composition.  It just feels a little too ''soft'' - maybe a bit oof?  Still, though, an excellent idea!', '2008-05-28 15:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
