(4730540, 682602, 88590, '<td valign="top">Just a touch too over-exposed for my liking.  Also, it is a little  ''soft'', or oof...?  Still, I like the pose and composition.  Good shot.</td>', 'Just a touch too over-exposed for my liking.  Also, it is a little  ''soft'', or oof...?  Still, I like the pose and composition.  Good shot.', '2008-05-28 15:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
