(4730656, 682453, 82503, '<td valign="top">My pick for the red (which would be fitting). Nice addition, I guess the model enjoyed the shoot. ;-)</td>', 'My pick for the red (which would be fitting). Nice addition, I guess the model enjoyed the shoot. ;-)', '2008-05-28 16:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730666, 682231, 91857, '<td valign="top">Great concept for a shot - shame about the burned out area of the LHS forehead.</td>', 'Great concept for a shot - shame about the burned out area of the LHS forehead.', '2008-05-28 16:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730725, 682260, 84779, '<td valign="top">nice shot 9</td>', 'nice shot 9', '2008-05-28 17:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730765, 682600, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great concept and composition. Noise is a little too much for my tastes (maybe that was intentional but I''d prefer more clarity).</td>', 'Great concept and composition. Noise is a little too much for my tastes (maybe that was intentional but I''d prefer more clarity).', '2008-05-28 17:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730769, 682896, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Much character in the face. The skin looks slightly unnatural-- possibly oversharpened? (still a great shot, just strikes me as a little over-textured)</td>', 'Great shot. Much character in the face. The skin looks slightly unnatural-- possibly oversharpened? (still a great shot, just strikes me as a little over-textured)', '2008-05-28 17:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730774, 682538, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great capture! What''s the guy on the bottom looking at?  :)</td>', 'Great capture! What''s the guy on the bottom looking at?  :)', '2008-05-28 17:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730779, 682469, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like the strong glare and close-up. I wish it was larger so we could see more detail-- it would give it a stronger impact.</td>', 'I like the strong glare and close-up. I wish it was larger so we could see more detail-- it would give it a stronger impact.', '2008-05-28 17:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730781, 682367, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, nice catch light in the eyes</td>', 'Great lighting, nice catch light in the eyes', '2008-05-28 17:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730783, 682722, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great expression and even lighting. I wish it was overall just slightly lighter and warmer. Detail in the eyes is almost lost in darkness. Still a great shot.</td>', 'Great expression and even lighting. I wish it was overall just slightly lighter and warmer. Detail in the eyes is almost lost in darkness. Still a great shot.', '2008-05-28 17:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730786, 682788, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Love the guitar position. Nice lighting alhtough overall exposure could be a little lighter.</td>', 'Nice composition. Love the guitar position. Nice lighting alhtough overall exposure could be a little lighter.', '2008-05-28 17:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730787, 682540, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great expression!</td>', 'Great expression!', '2008-05-28 17:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730788, 682402, 88204, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit noisy.</td>', 'Seems a bit noisy.', '2008-05-28 17:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730792, 682568, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great exposure and lighting.</td>', 'Great exposure and lighting.', '2008-05-28 17:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730795, 682260, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, composition / angle, nice catch light in the eyes. Very simple and well done!</td>', 'Great lighting, composition / angle, nice catch light in the eyes. Very simple and well done!', '2008-05-28 17:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730796, 682949, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great composition, even lighting, nice expression.</td>', 'Great composition, even lighting, nice expression.', '2008-05-28 17:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730798, 682240, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Nice lighting to catch the eyes in the sun.</td>', 'Great shot. Nice lighting to catch the eyes in the sun.', '2008-05-28 17:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730800, 682650, 67258, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I really go with this concept as a portrait as such.  I feel that a portrait should articulate something of the individual inside the model - be it in the environment, expression, or just that look in the eyes, but here I don''t feel any of those thongs.  Just empty.</td>', 'I''m not sure I really go with this concept as a portrait as such.  I feel that a portrait should articulate something of the individual inside the model - be it in the environment, expression, or just that look in the eyes, but here I don''t feel any of those thongs.  Just empty.', '2008-05-28 17:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730801, 682962, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great expression, nice sharpness and focus on the eyes</td>', 'Great expression, nice sharpness and focus on the eyes', '2008-05-28 17:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730804, 682787, 67258, '<td valign="top">Pleasing lighting and skin tones, and a nice quirky expression - although it has to be said, a rather demonic glint to the eyes!</td>', 'Pleasing lighting and skin tones, and a nice quirky expression - although it has to be said, a rather demonic glint to the eyes!', '2008-05-28 17:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730807, 682846, 67258, '<td valign="top">One of the very est that I have seen so far.</td>', 'One of the very est that I have seen so far.', '2008-05-28 17:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730810, 682683, 67258, '<td valign="top">Interesting - viewed this on my (abysmal) monitor at work, and all I could see was the fire.  Here at homeon my laptop the full image is visible.  I really like your idea of using firelight for the portrait, and having some context set, but to really pull it off I feel that you needed just a little more light.</td>', 'Interesting - viewed this on my (abysmal) monitor at work, and all I could see was the fire.  Here at homeon my laptop the full image is visible.  I really like your idea of using firelight for the portrait, and having some context set, but to really pull it off I feel that you needed just a little more light.', '2008-05-28 18:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730812, 682105, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super work!</td>', 'Super work!', '2008-05-28 18:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730814, 682974, 22301, '<td valign="top">There should really be a special medal given when you reach 500 challenges. Congratulations Robert. :)</td>', 'There should really be a special medal given when you reach 500 challenges. Congratulations Robert. :)', '2008-05-28 18:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730819, 682581, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful and gentle expression you have captured here.  it reminds me that there really is hope for humanity.  Wonderful.</td>', 'What a beautiful and gentle expression you have captured here.  it reminds me that there really is hope for humanity.  Wonderful.', '2008-05-28 18:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730834, 682684, 67258, '<td valign="top">Incredibly, extraordinarily cool image.</td>', 'Incredibly, extraordinarily cool image.', '2008-05-28 18:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730847, 682287, 67258, '<td valign="top">After the week Man U had, I am not quite sure why your model is looking so glum....  Not sure if it is an art effect filter you have used, or the photo has a noise problem, but the end result doesn''t, to my eyes at least, really compliment the photo.</td>', 'After the week Man U had, I am not quite sure why your model is looking so glum....  Not sure if it is an art effect filter you have used, or the photo has a noise problem, but the end result doesn''t, to my eyes at least, really compliment the photo.', '2008-05-28 18:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730850, 681342, 67258, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little overdone on the Neat Image or glow.  Otherwise a good competent portrait,</td>', 'Perhaps a little overdone on the Neat Image or glow.  Otherwise a good competent portrait,', '2008-05-28 18:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730853, 682527, 67258, '<td valign="top">The placement of the boats wake is rather unfortunate - almost as though your model is snorting a line of coke... That said, I like the idea of weaving a narrative into your portrait, and your title works well with this.</td>', 'The placement of the boats wake is rather unfortunate - almost as though your model is snorting a line of coke... That said, I like the idea of weaving a narrative into your portrait, and your title works well with this.', '2008-05-28 18:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730855, 681192, 67258, '<td valign="top">I really admire this - works as a portrait, but is oh so much more, too.</td>', 'I really admire this - works as a portrait, but is oh so much more, too.', '2008-05-28 18:17:16.000000', NULL, 1);
