(4731573, 682956, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love the interplay between light and dark, and how the background is so busy but because of the dark solid colors on your subject, he doesn''t get lost.</td>', 'I love the interplay between light and dark, and how the background is so busy but because of the dark solid colors on your subject, he doesn''t get lost.', '2008-05-28 23:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731577, 682453, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love the eye color... but I''m a little biased, LOL.  I wish the shirt didn''t fade into the background so much but I do like the dark hair and how that contrasts with the background, and the skin tone looks very nice.</td>', 'I love the eye color... but I''m a little biased, LOL.  I wish the shirt didn''t fade into the background so much but I do like the dark hair and how that contrasts with the background, and the skin tone looks very nice.', '2008-05-28 23:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
