(4731612, 682453, 43191, '<td valign="top">Good to see some humour.</td>', 'Good to see some humour.', '2008-05-29 00:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731619, 681735, 43191, '<td valign="top">Cute baby. The angle of the shot makes it feel like he is about to drop out of the bottom of the picture head first. If you have the chance to photograph him again, try getting down to his level (even if you have to lie on the floor) and shoot from there instead of from above, I think you will be happy with the results. :)</td>', 'Cute baby. The angle of the shot makes it feel like he is about to drop out of the bottom of the picture head first. If you have the chance to photograph him again, try getting down to his level (even if you have to lie on the floor) and shoot from there instead of from above, I think you will be happy with the results. :)', '2008-05-29 00:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731624, 682846, 43191, '<td valign="top">I like the shot of the boy''s face (the angle,expresion the highlights in his hair) however it looks as though he is about to be hit in the face with the ball. Maybe a hand in the shot would be better or get rid of the ball altogether? 7</td>', 'I like the shot of the boy''s face (the angle,expresion the highlights in his hair) however it looks as though he is about to be hit in the face with the ball. Maybe a hand in the shot would be better or get rid of the ball altogether? 7', '2008-05-29 00:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
