(4732104, 682540, 59751, '<td valign="top">That is a Keeper!</td>', 'That is a Keeper!', '2008-05-29 03:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732105, 681616, 59751, '<td valign="top">What a great shot!  Those eyes have seen more than I could begin to imagine.  Congratulations!</td>', 'What a great shot!  Those eyes have seen more than I could begin to imagine.  Congratulations!', '2008-05-29 03:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732109, 682288, 59751, '<td valign="top">Yikes!!  I''d love to critique this one, but am sudden feeling a bit nauseous!!</td>', 'Yikes!!  I''d love to critique this one, but am sudden feeling a bit nauseous!!', '2008-05-29 03:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732111, 682863, 59751, '<td valign="top">Great picture.</td>', 'Great picture.', '2008-05-29 03:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732122, 682600, 5364, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this, but I''m not sure about the soft focus. If it''s like this deliberately, then I don''t think you''ve made it grainy enough.</td>', 'I like the feel of this, but I''m not sure about the soft focus. If it''s like this deliberately, then I don''t think you''ve made it grainy enough.', '2008-05-29 03:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732130, 682487, 5364, '<td valign="top">This could be a charming portrait, but I find the soft focus clutter annoying. I would have preferred a might tighter crop around his face.</td>', 'This could be a charming portrait, but I find the soft focus clutter annoying. I would have preferred a might tighter crop around his face.', '2008-05-29 03:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732133, 682527, 5364, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea but having the ship''s wake coming out of his nose spoils the effect somewhat.</td>', 'Very nice idea but having the ship''s wake coming out of his nose spoils the effect somewhat.', '2008-05-29 04:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732138, 681735, 5364, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but you needed to get the eyes sharply in focus.</td>', 'I''m sorry but you needed to get the eyes sharply in focus.', '2008-05-29 04:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732140, 682975, 5364, '<td valign="top">This could be a nice portrait, but having the heart in focus rather that the person doesn''t appeal to me.</td>', 'This could be a nice portrait, but having the heart in focus rather that the person doesn''t appeal to me.', '2008-05-29 04:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732212, 682527, 78196, '<td valign="top">The lack of contrast in the image doesn''t particularly suit the monochrome conversion. Though I like the composition, the concept is a bit clichéd for me.</td>', 'The lack of contrast in the image doesn''t particularly suit the monochrome conversion. Though I like the composition, the concept is a bit clichéd for me.', '2008-05-29 05:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732214, 682568, 78196, '<td valign="top">The lighting and monochrome conversion are good despite some imperfections in the jpg conversion. However, I''m not ''getting anything'' from their expressions and can''t connect emotionally with the subjects in the way I''m looking for in this challenge.</td>', 'The lighting and monochrome conversion are good despite some imperfections in the jpg conversion. However, I''m not ''getting anything'' from their expressions and can''t connect emotionally with the subjects in the way I''m looking for in this challenge.', '2008-05-29 05:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732216, 682437, 78196, '<td valign="top">Very different - nicely converted and the quirky composition helps the image.</td>', 'Very different - nicely converted and the quirky composition helps the image.', '2008-05-29 05:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732217, 680815, 78196, '<td valign="top">Some constructive criticism: Firstly, the crop isn''t doing you any favours. It''s just too narrow to score highly. Secondly, the image doesn''t do well as a black and white as the lighting is very flat. The black cloth is clumsily arranged, meaning you have a knee floating in mid air and half a hand has been cut off. Most importantly, I don''t feel a connection with the subject - it''s for these reasons you''re scoring badly at the moment. I''m saying this to be helpful, not harsh - hope I have been.</td>', 'Some constructive criticism: Firstly, the crop isn''t doing you any favours. It''s just too narrow to score highly. Secondly, the image doesn''t do well as a black and white as the lighting is very flat. The black cloth is clumsily arranged, meaning you have a knee floating in mid air and half a hand has been cut off. Most importantly, I don''t feel a connection with the subject - it''s for these reasons you''re scoring badly at the moment. I''m saying this to be helpful, not harsh - hope I have been.', '2008-05-29 05:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732218, 681616, 78196, '<td valign="top">Good - nice and sharp and a face with lots of character.</td>', 'Good - nice and sharp and a face with lots of character.', '2008-05-29 05:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732220, 682758, 78196, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you''ve heard this ten times already, but the border has to go. You''ve captured an interesting subject but the slightly odd expression plus the sunglasses prevents us identifying with him and as such it doesn''t work as a portrait.</td>', 'I''m guessing you''ve heard this ten times already, but the border has to go. You''ve captured an interesting subject but the slightly odd expression plus the sunglasses prevents us identifying with him and as such it doesn''t work as a portrait.', '2008-05-29 05:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732221, 681557, 78196, '<td valign="top">Nice DoF and defiant expression.</td>', 'Nice DoF and defiant expression.', '2008-05-29 05:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732222, 682386, 78196, '<td valign="top">Ah, the concept here is really good - this is just screaming out for a good B&amp;W conversion and a bit of sharpening. It''s a pity the lighting conditions aren''t a little better but I love the concept and what you''ve captured here.</td>', 'Ah, the concept here is really good - this is just screaming out for a good B&W conversion and a bit of sharpening. It''s a pity the lighting conditions aren''t a little better but I love the concept and what you''ve captured here.', '2008-05-29 05:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732223, 682783, 78196, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve fallen into the trap of oversharpening this one a little - but the lighting is oddly effective. It''s a pity the background is dull, it doesn''t really vindicate your off-centre composition.</td>', 'I think you''ve fallen into the trap of oversharpening this one a little - but the lighting is oddly effective. It''s a pity the background is dull, it doesn''t really vindicate your off-centre composition.', '2008-05-29 05:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732224, 681164, 78196, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The harshness of the lighting is very well controlled and the effect is a good gritty, contrasty B&amp;W with a great expression captured. Good work.</td>', 'I really like this. The harshness of the lighting is very well controlled and the effect is a good gritty, contrasty B&W with a great expression captured. Good work.', '2008-05-29 05:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732226, 682975, 78196, '<td valign="top">It looks like you''ve focused on the heart rather than the subject - a smaller aperture would fix this one. I do like the concept but the lighting is harsh on the subject (See the shadow from the nose) and would benefit from a reflector on the other side.</td>', 'It looks like you''ve focused on the heart rather than the subject - a smaller aperture would fix this one. I do like the concept but the lighting is harsh on the subject (See the shadow from the nose) and would benefit from a reflector on the other side.', '2008-05-29 05:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732227, 682471, 78196, '<td valign="top">I like the stark simplicity of this. I''m wondering whether B&amp;W was the way to go as there''s not much towards the white end of things (perhaps a contrast boost) but the great control of light and blank expression gives us quite an insight here. Well done.</td>', 'I like the stark simplicity of this. I''m wondering whether B&W was the way to go as there''s not much towards the white end of things (perhaps a contrast boost) but the great control of light and blank expression gives us quite an insight here. Well done.', '2008-05-29 06:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732228, 682426, 78196, '<td valign="top">Good control of lighting and DoF.</td>', 'Good control of lighting and DoF.', '2008-05-29 06:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732229, 682402, 78196, '<td valign="top">Superbly weird. High marks from me for daring to be different.</td>', 'Superbly weird. High marks from me for daring to be different.', '2008-05-29 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732231, 682547, 78196, '<td valign="top">Excellent stuff. A really sharp, well lit shot that emphasises the boy''s curiosity. Really well done.</td>', 'Excellent stuff. A really sharp, well lit shot that emphasises the boy''s curiosity. Really well done.', '2008-05-29 06:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732234, 681391, 78196, '<td valign="top">The lighting is good but it''s much too sterile and perfunctory for me (such is the nature of the assignment), as well as obviously being too small!</td>', 'The lighting is good but it''s much too sterile and perfunctory for me (such is the nature of the assignment), as well as obviously being too small!', '2008-05-29 06:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732236, 682722, 78196, '<td valign="top">I would expect this to do fairly well - the lighting is pretty well controlled but unadventurous, I wonder if you could have been more daring with it. That said, I think you''ve captured a lot in the expression and it''s getting a high score from me.</td>', 'I would expect this to do fairly well - the lighting is pretty well controlled but unadventurous, I wonder if you could have been more daring with it. That said, I think you''ve captured a lot in the expression and it''s getting a high score from me.', '2008-05-29 06:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732237, 682740, 78196, '<td valign="top">This is scoring highly for me almost against my better judgement - the flat lighting lets the shot down I think. However, there is an insant connection with the subject (if only he was looking into the camera!) and as such is automatically one of the stronger images in the challenge. Well done.</td>', 'This is scoring highly for me almost against my better judgement - the flat lighting lets the shot down I think. However, there is an insant connection with the subject (if only he was looking into the camera!) and as such is automatically one of the stronger images in the challenge. Well done.', '2008-05-29 06:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732238, 681185, 78196, '<td valign="top">Well lit and super conversion.</td>', 'Well lit and super conversion.', '2008-05-29 06:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732239, 682287, 78196, '<td valign="top">But I thought United won the champions league?! On a photographic note - the image is obvoiusly low resolution and the lighting is unsuitable for portraiture.</td>', 'But I thought United won the champions league?! On a photographic note - the image is obvoiusly low resolution and the lighting is unsuitable for portraiture.', '2008-05-29 06:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732241, 681735, 78196, '<td valign="top">Awkwardly composed and the flash (or is it just very flat lighting?) ruins the image for me.</td>', 'Awkwardly composed and the flash (or is it just very flat lighting?) ruins the image for me.', '2008-05-29 06:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732242, 682338, 78196, '<td valign="top">I like this but there''s something a little awkward about a candid where the subject is bang in the middle of the frame - I''d like to see him off-centre but that''s just a personal thing. I think I''d prefer to see his face out of the shadows as well. Having said that, I think the candid is great and the expression you''ve captured is very telling. Well done.</td>', 'I like this but there''s something a little awkward about a candid where the subject is bang in the middle of the frame - I''d like to see him off-centre but that''s just a personal thing. I think I''d prefer to see his face out of the shadows as well. Having said that, I think the candid is great and the expression you''ve captured is very telling. Well done.', '2008-05-29 06:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732243, 682240, 78196, '<td valign="top">If I''m being perfectly honest, the over-processing doesn''t hide the lack of sharpness in the original and the title is a little self-conscious. Now that''s out the way I love the harsh lighting and the intensity you''ve captured in his face.</td>', 'If I''m being perfectly honest, the over-processing doesn''t hide the lack of sharpness in the original and the title is a little self-conscious. Now that''s out the way I love the harsh lighting and the intensity you''ve captured in his face.', '2008-05-29 06:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732244, 681965, 78196, '<td valign="top">Enjoyably mad. The boat (is that a boat?) to the right and the well-controlled use of the sun in the frame are both nice touches.</td>', 'Enjoyably mad. The boat (is that a boat?) to the right and the well-controlled use of the sun in the frame are both nice touches.', '2008-05-29 06:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732245, 681603, 78196, '<td valign="top">A very nice idea let down by a lack of contrast in the subject''s face but I don''t suppose you could have had much control over lighting in that venue. I don''t know if it''s intentional but the title comes across as slightly ironic as the subject seems almost sullen and disconnected with the microphone. An interesting image anyway.</td>', 'A very nice idea let down by a lack of contrast in the subject''s face but I don''t suppose you could have had much control over lighting in that venue. I don''t know if it''s intentional but the title comes across as slightly ironic as the subject seems almost sullen and disconnected with the microphone. An interesting image anyway.', '2008-05-29 06:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732246, 682556, 78196, '<td valign="top">A very brave entry. I''m sure it wasn''t possible but eye contact would have made the intensity of the shot almost unbearable - the idea of a connection being made one way but only partly the other.</td>', 'A very brave entry. I''m sure it wasn''t possible but eye contact would have made the intensity of the shot almost unbearable - the idea of a connection being made one way but only partly the other.', '2008-05-29 06:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732248, 681617, 78196, '<td valign="top">There''s another image that''s lit in a similar way and whilst I quite like the effect on the eyes, the overall flatness of the lighting really goes against you here, and everything seems too bright on the subject''s face. I think the crop needs to be a bit less severe as well.</td>', 'There''s another image that''s lit in a similar way and whilst I quite like the effect on the eyes, the overall flatness of the lighting really goes against you here, and everything seems too bright on the subject''s face. I think the crop needs to be a bit less severe as well.', '2008-05-29 06:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732252, 682798, 78196, '<td valign="top">Good shot, Sara. Lighting is well controlled and the tilted composition is nicely quirky. On a personal level the connection with the subject that I saw in a couple of your other shots is lacking here IMO. (no vote)</td>', 'Good shot, Sara. Lighting is well controlled and the tilted composition is nicely quirky. On a personal level the connection with the subject that I saw in a couple of your other shots is lacking here IMO. (no vote)', '2008-05-29 06:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732255, 682945, 78196, '<td valign="top">Do you know what - I normally hate kid shots but this one has bags of character and is really well lit. Good job!</td>', 'Do you know what - I normally hate kid shots but this one has bags of character and is really well lit. Good job!', '2008-05-29 06:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732258, 681489, 78196, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, Juliet - interesting to see you went for a different one, and here the duotone works nicely in your favour. The one thing that lets in down IMO is the flat lighting on the subject itself but the clouds are brought out awesomely for a basic editing challenge. Well done! (no vote)</td>', 'Nice shot, Juliet - interesting to see you went for a different one, and here the duotone works nicely in your favour. The one thing that lets in down IMO is the flat lighting on the subject itself but the clouds are brought out awesomely for a basic editing challenge. Well done! (no vote)', '2008-05-29 06:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732261, 682416, 78196, '<td valign="top">Great, but needs a touch more contrast (more towards the white end) to function really well as a monochrome image.</td>', 'Great, but needs a touch more contrast (more towards the white end) to function really well as a monochrome image.', '2008-05-29 06:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732263, 682794, 78196, '<td valign="top">Great, but unfortunately the harshness of the lighting means the right eye is lost in the shadows.</td>', 'Great, but unfortunately the harshness of the lighting means the right eye is lost in the shadows.', '2008-05-29 06:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732264, 682601, 78196, '<td valign="top">Good concept though I''d like something less ''blank'' from the expression. I reckon you can crop a bit more at the top, too.</td>', 'Good concept though I''d like something less ''blank'' from the expression. I reckon you can crop a bit more at the top, too.', '2008-05-29 06:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732266, 682443, 78196, '<td valign="top">Think I recognise Jeffrey here - great and very well-executed concept. That combined with excellent lighting a great conversion means a high score from me. Well done!</td>', 'Think I recognise Jeffrey here - great and very well-executed concept. That combined with excellent lighting a great conversion means a high score from me. Well done!', '2008-05-29 06:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732280, 681701, 72950, '<td valign="top">sharp and well composed..</td>', 'sharp and well composed..', '2008-05-29 06:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732282, 682722, 72950, '<td valign="top">clean shot..nice smile</td>', 'clean shot..nice smile', '2008-05-29 07:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732315, 682896, 78196, '<td valign="top">It''s always difficult to tell with your own image whether or not you''ve taken the post-processing too far - for me the HDR treatment is really overdone and gives the image a very unnatural feel.</td>', 'It''s always difficult to tell with your own image whether or not you''ve taken the post-processing too far - for me the HDR treatment is really overdone and gives the image a very unnatural feel.', '2008-05-29 07:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732317, 682504, 78196, '<td valign="top">This is really excellent stuff with a very good conversion - just be careful on the white side of the histogram as the whites to the right look a wee bit blown out and it''s a bit of a distraction. But a completely charming portrait with superb control of DoF.</td>', 'This is really excellent stuff with a very good conversion - just be careful on the white side of the histogram as the whites to the right look a wee bit blown out and it''s a bit of a distraction. But a completely charming portrait with superb control of DoF.', '2008-05-29 07:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732350, 682538, 78196, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition - a really fun shot.</td>', 'Awesome composition - a really fun shot.', '2008-05-29 08:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732353, 682418, 78196, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is a bit too flat for the black and white conversion to work successfully. For me, the subject is a bit too detached for this to work well as a portrait.</td>', 'The lighting here is a bit too flat for the black and white conversion to work successfully. For me, the subject is a bit too detached for this to work well as a portrait.', '2008-05-29 08:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732356, 682004, 78196, '<td valign="top">Not a huge fan of the white background but the lighting is good. I''m not getting much of a connection with the subject''s blank expression, which is something I think is necessary with a good portrait.</td>', 'Not a huge fan of the white background but the lighting is good. I''m not getting much of a connection with the subject''s blank expression, which is something I think is necessary with a good portrait.', '2008-05-29 08:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732358, 682786, 78196, '<td valign="top">The lighting is not ideal here but you''ve captured a great expression which really seems to tell the viewer a lot about this man''s character. Well done.</td>', 'The lighting is not ideal here but you''ve captured a great expression which really seems to tell the viewer a lot about this man''s character. Well done.', '2008-05-29 09:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732360, 680938, 78196, '<td valign="top">Good. Well composed and well lit. Processing is slightly overdone for my taste.</td>', 'Good. Well composed and well lit. Processing is slightly overdone for my taste.', '2008-05-29 09:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732361, 682320, 78196, '<td valign="top">Nice environmental portrait, though I''d like to see a little more of the man.</td>', 'Nice environmental portrait, though I''d like to see a little more of the man.', '2008-05-29 09:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732363, 682962, 78196, '<td valign="top">Really interesting choice of subject and a good, edgy composition. Black and white conversion is a little on the flat side and could do with some more contrast.</td>', 'Really interesting choice of subject and a good, edgy composition. Black and white conversion is a little on the flat side and could do with some more contrast.', '2008-05-29 09:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732366, 682554, 78196, '<td valign="top">I don''t believe that portraits necessarily have to show the subject''s face (there are some excellent examples of back-of-head shots on DPC) but I do think that where you''re going to break from the norm and go for something different, you need to have an artistic reason for doing so - in other words you need to communicate something when deliberately not showing the face. This to me, if I''m honest, just looks like a snapshot of the back of someone''s head and as such does not work well as a portrait.</td>', 'I don''t believe that portraits necessarily have to show the subject''s face (there are some excellent examples of back-of-head shots on DPC) but I do think that where you''re going to break from the norm and go for something different, you need to have an artistic reason for doing so - in other words you need to communicate something when deliberately not showing the face. This to me, if I''m honest, just looks like a snapshot of the back of someone''s head and as such does not work well as a portrait.', '2008-05-29 09:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732368, 681608, 78196, '<td valign="top">Pure joy. Could do with a little sharpening but a super photo, well converted.</td>', 'Pure joy. Could do with a little sharpening but a super photo, well converted.', '2008-05-29 09:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732371, 681555, 78196, '<td valign="top">Too contrived for my liking but I can''t fault it photographically - the lighting is good and it''s a great conversion. Nicely done.</td>', 'Too contrived for my liking but I can''t fault it photographically - the lighting is good and it''s a great conversion. Nicely done.', '2008-05-29 09:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732372, 682539, 78196, '<td valign="top">Mental. Love it.</td>', 'Mental. Love it.', '2008-05-29 09:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732376, 682540, 78196, '<td valign="top">Ha! Hilarious expression.</td>', 'Ha! Hilarious expression.', '2008-05-29 09:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732378, 682957, 78196, '<td valign="top">Definitely different but the subject''s face is in the shadows (hence the obvious lack of contrast, I''m guessing) and lacks drama as a result.  A simple reflector could make the world of difference here.</td>', 'Definitely different but the subject''s face is in the shadows (hence the obvious lack of contrast, I''m guessing) and lacks drama as a result.  A simple reflector could make the world of difference here.', '2008-05-29 09:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732381, 682005, 78196, '<td valign="top">Very different and interesting but needs a little basic post-processing to introduce more contrast to the image. Not convinced by the border, either. But definitely an interesting shot - thanks for submitting it.</td>', 'Very different and interesting but needs a little basic post-processing to introduce more contrast to the image. Not convinced by the border, either. But definitely an interesting shot - thanks for submitting it.', '2008-05-29 09:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732383, 682738, 78196, '<td valign="top">Well, this could be straight out of a magazine. The lighting and conversion is just spot on. If anything it''s a bit too commercial and not human enough to satisfy what I like best about portraiture, but the technicals are all there. Don''t like his belly-button though!</td>', 'Well, this could be straight out of a magazine. The lighting and conversion is just spot on. If anything it''s a bit too commercial and not human enough to satisfy what I like best about portraiture, but the technicals are all there. Don''t like his belly-button though!', '2008-05-29 09:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732384, 681250, 78196, '<td valign="top">Great. Nicely lit and converted (just be really careful with the highlights!) and a great expression captured.</td>', 'Great. Nicely lit and converted (just be really careful with the highlights!) and a great expression captured.', '2008-05-29 09:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732386, 682288, 78196, '<td valign="top">Well that''s pretty grim! Not exactly a profound insight into the subject but great fun and very different.</td>', 'Well that''s pretty grim! Not exactly a profound insight into the subject but great fun and very different.', '2008-05-29 09:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732387, 682963, 78196, '<td valign="top">Fearsome beard and fearsome expression. Well lit, too.</td>', 'Fearsome beard and fearsome expression. Well lit, too.', '2008-05-29 09:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732389, 682915, 78196, '<td valign="top">Well lit but watch out for the burnt shadows - it''s just a bit too much here. Dead sharp, though.</td>', 'Well lit but watch out for the burnt shadows - it''s just a bit too much here. Dead sharp, though.', '2008-05-29 09:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732401, 682650, 78196, '<td valign="top">If this is Tim''s image I know you''re probably going to be annoyed I''ve recognised it! But you shouldn''t worry as your shots are always inventive and interesting, and I like this one a lot too.</td>', 'If this is Tim''s image I know you''re probably going to be annoyed I''ve recognised it! But you shouldn''t worry as your shots are always inventive and interesting, and I like this one a lot too.', '2008-05-29 09:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732403, 682231, 78196, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept indeed, let down a little by the poorer lighting on the subject on the right. But I like this one too much to let that bother me.</td>', 'Very nice concept indeed, let down a little by the poorer lighting on the subject on the right. But I like this one too much to let that bother me.', '2008-05-29 09:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732404, 681334, 78196, '<td valign="top">I love this lighting. It''s obviously at the expense of us making a connection with the subject''s face, but his pose is enough and the obscure blueness on the right is another intriguing touch.</td>', 'I love this lighting. It''s obviously at the expense of us making a connection with the subject''s face, but his pose is enough and the obscure blueness on the right is another intriguing touch.', '2008-05-29 09:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732406, 682625, 78196, '<td valign="top">The lighting lacks contrast for an effective B&amp;W image and the processing is definitely overdone for me.</td>', 'The lighting lacks contrast for an effective B&W image and the processing is definitely overdone for me.', '2008-05-29 09:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732409, 680958, 78196, '<td valign="top">Lacks a wee bit of sharpness but this is a wonderful capture of interaction between humans. A pretty loose interpretation of a portrait but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'Lacks a wee bit of sharpness but this is a wonderful capture of interaction between humans. A pretty loose interpretation of a portrait but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.', '2008-05-29 09:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732410, 681773, 78196, '<td valign="top">Very odd. I''m sure there''s a reference I''m not getting. But, as always, I like stuff that''s different.</td>', 'Very odd. I''m sure there''s a reference I''m not getting. But, as always, I like stuff that''s different.', '2008-05-29 09:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732412, 682726, 78196, '<td valign="top">Different. Good processing and I like the dichotomy of your concept.</td>', 'Different. Good processing and I like the dichotomy of your concept.', '2008-05-29 09:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
