(4733763, 682483, 54645, '<td valign="top">Sharp image, cute, but not terribly compelling. He sure seems to be having fun!</td>', 'Sharp image, cute, but not terribly compelling. He sure seems to be having fun!', '2008-05-29 23:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733765, 681603, 54645, '<td valign="top">The DOF and composition hurt this image. He looks like he is in a box. Face is exposed well.</td>', 'The DOF and composition hurt this image. He looks like he is in a box. Face is exposed well.', '2008-05-29 23:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733768, 682794, 54645, '<td valign="top">interesting image. I wish I could see his left eye. Chimmney is a bright distraction.</td>', 'interesting image. I wish I could see his left eye. Chimmney is a bright distraction.', '2008-05-29 23:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733775, 682547, 54645, '<td valign="top">great tone. He looks like he was wrestling with his brother! I don''t like the object on the left, behind the arm. 6</td>', 'great tone. He looks like he was wrestling with his brother! I don''t like the object on the left, behind the arm. 6', '2008-05-29 23:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733786, 682962, 54645, '<td valign="top">Great! Love the conversion. Crooked glasses for crooked eyes and a nose. Of course he would want me to smoke!<br/>The beard, IMO, is oversharpened, halos are distracting as the beard is one of the brightest objects in the image. Same about the cig, as I believe your intended subject is the face. Overall, I love this image, one of my favorites thus far. 7</td>', 'Great! Love the conversion. Crooked glasses for crooked eyes and a nose. Of course he would want me to smoke!The beard, IMO, is oversharpened, halos are distracting as the beard is one of the brightest objects in the image. Same about the cig, as I believe your intended subject is the face. Overall, I love this image, one of my favorites thus far. 7', '2008-05-29 23:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733789, 682963, 54645, '<td valign="top">Imposing image. I like the light. I wonder how it would feel from a lower, closer, perspective. (Any comments about the t-shirt yet?).</td>', 'Imposing image. I like the light. I wonder how it would feel from a lower, closer, perspective. (Any comments about the t-shirt yet?).', '2008-05-29 23:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733799, 682722, 54645, '<td valign="top">Gentle trusting image . I like the single gray eyebrow hair! I would love to see a BW conversion.</td>', 'Gentle trusting image . I like the single gray eyebrow hair! I would love to see a BW conversion.', '2008-05-29 23:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733806, 681300, 54645, '<td valign="top">OK, steady yourself! Not my definition of a portrait. Too much going on in the background gives this a snapshot feel. Color and focus are good. Maybe tighter FOV and less DOF. I think a crop without the left 1/3, showing the man and his trike, supported by a 25mph speed limit sign, would be quite a funny image. 4</td>', 'OK, steady yourself! Not my definition of a portrait. Too much going on in the background gives this a snapshot feel. Color and focus are good. Maybe tighter FOV and less DOF. I think a crop without the left 1/3, showing the man and his trike, supported by a 25mph speed limit sign, would be quite a funny image. 4', '2008-05-29 23:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733808, 682683, 54645, '<td valign="top">Not enough subject for my interpretation. Good thought.</td>', 'Not enough subject for my interpretation. Good thought.', '2008-05-29 23:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733810, 681608, 54645, '<td valign="top">Makes me smile!</td>', 'Makes me smile!', '2008-05-29 23:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
