(4735820, 682418, 67258, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this was taken from behind a screen?  There is a textural effect visible on the hair and part of the helmet that to my eyes at least doesn''t really add anything to the overall image, and the overall feel is one of soft focus, where for this subject I feel a sharper image would be more suited.  It is a shame that the helmet strap is undone - I think the model would look more single-mindedly focussed with it fastened.</td>', 'I wonder if this was taken from behind a screen?  There is a textural effect visible on the hair and part of the helmet that to my eyes at least doesn''t really add anything to the overall image, and the overall feel is one of soft focus, where for this subject I feel a sharper image would be more suited.  It is a shame that the helmet strap is undone - I think the model would look more single-mindedly focussed with it fastened.', '2008-05-31 04:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
