(4737117, 682357, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the distracting pattern is. Besides that the focus is soft, the lighting bad, and the angle isn''t a good one. These shots are hard. Were you shooting at high ISO? <br/> <br/>As a jazz fan, I''m curious to know who this is. It looks like maybe it was shot at an outdoor festival or something.</td>', 'Not sure what the distracting pattern is. Besides that the focus is soft, the lighting bad, and the angle isn''t a good one. These shots are hard. Were you shooting at high ISO?  As a jazz fan, I''m curious to know who this is. It looks like maybe it was shot at an outdoor festival or something.', '2008-06-01 01:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
