(4743479, 682960, 2764, '<td valign="top">Uh oh - this is going to get "monitor calibration" comments.  It''s never safe to enter something so dark because many monitors will see it as TOO dark.  For me the hat (is he wearing a hat?) and everything above his eyebrows is completely dark except for a hint of hatband.  (yes, I can see all the gradations of the darkness scale)</td>', 'Uh oh - this is going to get "monitor calibration" comments.  It''s never safe to enter something so dark because many monitors will see it as TOO dark.  For me the hat (is he wearing a hat?) and everything above his eyebrows is completely dark except for a hint of hatband.  (yes, I can see all the gradations of the darkness scale)', '2008-06-02 22:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4743491, 682961, 2764, '<td valign="top">His face and trumpet are wonderfull but the image is dominated by his white sleeve - white attracts the viewers eye.  Would I look at his face sooner if some of his elbow was cropped out?  I like how the swoop of his hair matches the swoop of his eyebrows, bot a bit unruly.</td>', 'His face and trumpet are wonderfull but the image is dominated by his white sleeve - white attracts the viewers eye.  Would I look at his face sooner if some of his elbow was cropped out?  I like how the swoop of his hair matches the swoop of his eyebrows, bot a bit unruly.', '2008-06-02 22:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
