(4747720, 681557, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting to note that it''s hard to put a comment to a score.  I gave this an 8, thought it was a very well done portrait.  Take my 8 out of the equation and you''re left with an average score of 4.6667 for the remaining 6 commenters (all of which had something positive to say). ???<br/> <br/>You''ve left no details about the man in your shot in the photographer''s comments area.  :-/  I hope he''s given a print to share/display with his family.  It''s certainly a portrait worth framing.  :-)</td>', 'Interesting to note that it''s hard to put a comment to a score.  I gave this an 8, thought it was a very well done portrait.  Take my 8 out of the equation and you''re left with an average score of 4.6667 for the remaining 6 commenters (all of which had something positive to say). ??? You''ve left no details about the man in your shot in the photographer''s comments area.  :-/  I hope he''s given a print to share/display with his family.  It''s certainly a portrait worth framing.  :-)', '2008-06-04 09:27:48.000000', NULL, 0),
