(4748597, 682692, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice natural light. I think with a tighter crop and perhaps a bit of rotation, you might be able to get a more dramatic image. As is, I think that this portrait would hold interest for the model and his friends and family, but not for many others.</td>', 'Nice natural light. I think with a tighter crop and perhaps a bit of rotation, you might be able to get a more dramatic image. As is, I think that this portrait would hold interest for the model and his friends and family, but not for many others.', '2008-06-04 13:12:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4748609, 682798, 66384, '<td valign="top">I really like this portrait. Nice strong face. The lighting is quite dramatic, but not overly so. The rotation really works well. I find the string on his neck distracting -- it fights with the other lines in his shirt and tie.</td>', 'I really like this portrait. Nice strong face. The lighting is quite dramatic, but not overly so. The rotation really works well. I find the string on his neck distracting -- it fights with the other lines in his shirt and tie.', '2008-06-04 13:18:27.000000', NULL, 0),
