(4749575, 682915, 33068, '<td valign="top">It''s hard enough shooting a model but it takes real skill to shoot a sp and achieve this type of result.  The lighting is spot on.  Amazing!</td>', 'It''s hard enough shooting a model but it takes real skill to shoot a sp and achieve this type of result.  The lighting is spot on.  Amazing!', '2008-06-04 18:37:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4749673, 682623, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wow Alicia, I thought this was a GREAT portrait.  I loved the lighting you used and the black and white conversion was absolutely spot on.  I have to say that this is the sort of portrait that I would love to be able to take.  I cant believe anyone scored this less than a 5 even on DPC<br/> <br/>Sod the scores, this is a definite keeper!</td>', 'Wow Alicia, I thought this was a GREAT portrait.  I loved the lighting you used and the black and white conversion was absolutely spot on.  I have to say that this is the sort of portrait that I would love to be able to take.  I cant believe anyone scored this less than a 5 even on DPC Sod the scores, this is a definite keeper!', '2008-06-04 19:35:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4749678, 682695, 68035, '<td valign="top">I know what you mean about the sun but I still think this is a great portrait which captures the spirit of the moment<br/> <br/>As ever nice Black and White conversion and super bokeh to bring the subject out</td>', 'I know what you mean about the sun but I still think this is a great portrait which captures the spirit of the moment As ever nice Black and White conversion and super bokeh to bring the subject out', '2008-06-04 19:40:30.000000', NULL, 0),
