(4750280, 680786, 75171, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, it''s too bad the average vote wasn''t higher...I agree with the idea of having him look into the camera-it would''ve made the photo that much more complete/effective. :)</td>', 'I love this photo, it''s too bad the average vote wasn''t higher...I agree with the idea of having him look into the camera-it would''ve made the photo that much more complete/effective. :)', '2008-06-04 23:20:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4750292, 682443, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that you used this challenge to do more than a straight portrait. The message I got from the shot was that this person (I knew who it was) is a bit of a puzzle -- or perhaps that you are showing us only one piece of this complex person. I think you did a good job of getting the point across, and I am amazed at how well you were able to match the puzzle piece to your face.</td>', 'I like the fact that you used this challenge to do more than a straight portrait. The message I got from the shot was that this person (I knew who it was) is a bit of a puzzle -- or perhaps that you are showing us only one piece of this complex person. I think you did a good job of getting the point across, and I am amazed at how well you were able to match the puzzle piece to your face.', '2008-06-04 23:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4750296, 680786, 75171, '<td valign="top">ps. the way he''s looking off to the side adds depth and reflection though ;) -and i do love that aspect</td>', 'ps. the way he''s looking off to the side adds depth and reflection though ;) -and i do love that aspect', '2008-06-04 23:23:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4750316, 682383, 66384, '<td valign="top">How cute. I like the way he is grasping the little cup, but I am most drawn to those amazing eyelashes. Beautiful clarity, composition, DOF, and color.</td>', 'How cute. I like the way he is grasping the little cup, but I am most drawn to those amazing eyelashes. Beautiful clarity, composition, DOF, and color.', '2008-06-04 23:29:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4750424, 682695, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the image because of the happiness in this man''s face. Also there is enough surrounding information to get a good idea of who he is. The lighting is harsh, but I don''t mind that, since it is part of the story -- he''s a native American, outside, in the sunshine, having a very good time.  Nice candid capture.</td>', 'I like the image because of the happiness in this man''s face. Also there is enough surrounding information to get a good idea of who he is. The lighting is harsh, but I don''t mind that, since it is part of the story -- he''s a native American, outside, in the sunshine, having a very good time.  Nice candid capture.', '2008-06-05 00:08:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4750632, 682783, 70514, '<td valign="top">Larry,<br/> <br/>The expression you captured is emotive in a very unespected way.  It really draws me in.  <br/> <br/>Congrats on your PB!  Truly well deserved.  <br/> <br/>C.</td>', 'Larry, The expression you captured is emotive in a very unespected way.  It really draws me in.   Congrats on your PB!  Truly well deserved.   C.', '2008-06-05 01:26:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4750636, 682623, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love how the composition is a bit unexpected, it goes so well with his hint of a smile and the low lighting.  It''s all a bit out of the box, but very effective.</td>', 'I love how the composition is a bit unexpected, it goes so well with his hint of a smile and the low lighting.  It''s all a bit out of the box, but very effective.', '2008-06-05 01:28:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4750643, 682695, 70514, '<td valign="top">Wonderful that you caught the motion in his hair like that.  Really adds to his personality and smile.  Great capture!</td>', 'Wonderful that you caught the motion in his hair like that.  Really adds to his personality and smile.  Great capture!', '2008-06-05 01:31:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4750675, 681489, 52549, '<td valign="top">I think you did a great job here, Juliet. It looks like a film photo from years gone by. Your model is indeed VERY yummy ;-)</td>', 'I think you did a great job here, Juliet. It looks like a film photo from years gone by. Your model is indeed VERY yummy ;-)', '2008-06-05 01:53:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4750768, 680727, 73452, '<td valign="top">This is so underrated, im astounded.  Still a fantastic image, really do enjjoy it</td>', 'This is so underrated, im astounded.  Still a fantastic image, really do enjjoy it', '2008-06-05 03:18:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4750830, 682620, 67258, '<td valign="top">Guarav, you have the basis of a good portrait here, with a good pose, and lovely expression.  A suggestion for next time would be to stand further away from your background.  Also nearly all digital photographs benefit from a little post-processing, even if it is only to shrpen them.  If you haven''t got any software, try googling GIMP - it is pretty much along the lines of Photoshop, but free!</td>', 'Guarav, you have the basis of a good portrait here, with a good pose, and lovely expression.  A suggestion for next time would be to stand further away from your background.  Also nearly all digital photographs benefit from a little post-processing, even if it is only to shrpen them.  If you haven''t got any software, try googling GIMP - it is pretty much along the lines of Photoshop, but free!', '2008-06-05 03:58:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4750984, 682738, 27845, '<td valign="top">Gléckwonsch fir d''Top10.</td>', 'Gléckwonsch fir d''Top10.', '2008-06-05 07:12:08.000000', NULL, 0),
