(4751469, 682945, 20577, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is fantastic. However, I am concerned that you are pushing the boy too hard. You should at least let him learn to walk before you start making him take piano lessons. I know you had a dream of being a concert pianist, but that doesn''t mean you should push your dreams on your children. You had your chance and you got hurt. It was a tragic when you slammed your finger in that door, but that''s life man. You have to let it go. Let him be little... don''t be a stage dad and ruin his life.</td>', 'I think this photo is fantastic. However, I am concerned that you are pushing the boy too hard. You should at least let him learn to walk before you start making him take piano lessons. I know you had a dream of being a concert pianist, but that doesn''t mean you should push your dreams on your children. You had your chance and you got hurt. It was a tragic when you slammed your finger in that door, but that''s life man. You have to let it go. Let him be little... don''t be a stage dad and ruin his life.', '2008-06-05 11:21:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4751533, 680938, 89669, '<td valign="top">For what it''s worth, you were in my top three.</td>', 'For what it''s worth, you were in my top three.', '2008-06-05 12:05:14.000000', NULL, 0),
