(4751915, 682617, 66384, '<td valign="top">What an adorable funny expression. He seems to be really enjoying that tall grass. This is the sort of photo every Grandmother would treasure. I like the textures in this image -- the soft hair, and the wispy grass.</td>', 'What an adorable funny expression. He seems to be really enjoying that tall grass. This is the sort of photo every Grandmother would treasure. I like the textures in this image -- the soft hair, and the wispy grass.', '2008-06-05 15:07:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4751921, 682956, 66384, '<td valign="top">He looks like things are not going so well. Did you catch him at something other than fishing? Is he hiding something behind that bush? Did you invade his private fishing spot or ruin his solitude? It''s a fun photo to ponder, and I like the light on the leaves and the water.</td>', 'He looks like things are not going so well. Did you catch him at something other than fishing? Is he hiding something behind that bush? Did you invade his private fishing spot or ruin his solitude? It''s a fun photo to ponder, and I like the light on the leaves and the water.', '2008-06-05 15:13:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4751927, 682347, 66384, '<td valign="top">You captured a lot of emotion in his face. I''m not sure whether he is about to cry, has just stopped crying, or is about to smile. Whatever the situation, he is adorable, and the light, focus, and color are very nice.</td>', 'You captured a lot of emotion in his face. I''m not sure whether he is about to cry, has just stopped crying, or is about to smile. Whatever the situation, he is adorable, and the light, focus, and color are very nice.', '2008-06-05 15:16:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4751969, 681300, 66384, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice event photo, although I''m not sure I would consider it a portrait. I guess the voters didn''t think so either. Anyway, the event looks like fun -- you captured that nicely.</td>', 'It''s a nice event photo, although I''m not sure I would consider it a portrait. I guess the voters didn''t think so either. Anyway, the event looks like fun -- you captured that nicely.', '2008-06-05 15:45:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4751996, 681883, 66384, '<td valign="top">What a nice expression you captured on that handsome man! I feel like the image needs a little levels or brightness adjustment -- it seems a bit dim.</td>', 'What a nice expression you captured on that handsome man! I feel like the image needs a little levels or brightness adjustment -- it seems a bit dim.', '2008-06-05 15:53:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4752019, 682231, 29011, '<td valign="top">Both of your expressions are simply hilariously perfect. The lighting is different on your faces , perhaps why it scored lower? the space between you two works well for me though. As does that your heads dont align. Adds to the comedic aspect of the shot.<br/> <br/>A fun shot after all, well done. Reminds me of the movie Twins or flicks which have movie posters with a similar theme.</td>', 'Both of your expressions are simply hilariously perfect. The lighting is different on your faces , perhaps why it scored lower? the space between you two works well for me though. As does that your heads dont align. Adds to the comedic aspect of the shot. A fun shot after all, well done. Reminds me of the movie Twins or flicks which have movie posters with a similar theme.', '2008-06-05 15:58:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4752137, 680727, 91679, '<td valign="top">kind of boring</td>', 'kind of boring', '2008-06-05 16:33:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4752198, 681696, 46177, '<td valign="top">Well, I liked your Gypsy. I gave you a 7, I did notice it was a bit soft but that didn''t take away from it for me, he has a very interesting face and I loved the expression.  He looks so self satisfied and content, the softness gives him a sort of glow which I think really suited everything about him.  I can''t explain why but he gives me a sense of freedom.  <br/>Anyway I don''t think your score should have been so low and I don''t always agree that everything has to be totally sharp, if it works it works and this one did for me.</td>', 'Well, I liked your Gypsy. I gave you a 7, I did notice it was a bit soft but that didn''t take away from it for me, he has a very interesting face and I loved the expression.  He looks so self satisfied and content, the softness gives him a sort of glow which I think really suited everything about him.  I can''t explain why but he gives me a sense of freedom.  Anyway I don''t think your score should have been so low and I don''t always agree that everything has to be totally sharp, if it works it works and this one did for me.', '2008-06-05 17:09:19.000000', NULL, 0),
